<title>PORTUGAL: EU seeks details of Portugal Lisnave plan.</title>
<headline>EU seeks details of Portugal Lisnave plan.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has asked for more information about a restructuring plan for ship repairer Lisnave-Estaleiros Navais de Lisboa to see whether it involves state aid to a private group, newspapers reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The restructuring split up the old company with the state taking responsibility for a human resources company set up with excess labour from the old industrial operations.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113126</p>
